    "text": [
        {
            "jpName": "ナイスネイチャ",
            "enName": "Nice Nature",
            "jpText": "ターボ、誕生日おめでとう。",
            "enText": "Turbo, happy birthday.",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "pathId": 2230599885884644145,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "イクノディクタス",
            "enName": "Ikuno Dictus",
            "jpText": "おめでとうございます、ターボさん。\r\nささやかですがお誕生会も用意してますよ。",
            "enText": "Happy birthday, Turbo. It's nothing \nimpressive, but we planned a little \nbirthday party for you.",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "pathId": 3726331413050355016,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ツインターボ",
            "enName": "Twin Turbo",
            "jpText": "ほんとっ！？　わーいお誕生会！！\n今日の主役はターボね！",
            "enText": "For real?! Woohoo, a birthday party!! \nAnd Turbo's the birthday girl!",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "pathId": 5113693944777879795,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ナイスネイチャ",
            "enName": "Nice Nature",
            "jpText": "そんで、数日後にはアタシとイクノの\n誕生日がやってくると。",
            "enText": "By the way, it'll be Ikuno's and my birthday \nin a few days too.",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "pathId": 6352579323656185345,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "イクノディクタス",
            "enName": "Ikuno Dictus",
            "jpText": "はい、お祝い事がまとまっていると\n嬉しい気持ちになりますね。",
            "enText": "Indeed. Having multiple celebrations \nclumped together makes the occasion \nall the more festive.",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "voiceIdx": 4,
            "pathId": 7540875133555190107,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ツインターボ",
            "enName": "Twin Turbo",
            "jpText": "3人の中だとターボが\r\n誕生日1番乗りなんだ……。",
            "enText": "So among us three, Turbo's birthday \ncomes first…",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "voiceIdx": 5,
            "pathId": -7479480799585301865,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ツインターボ",
            "enName": "Twin Turbo",
            "jpText": "っ……ふふふ～ん！",
            "enText": "…Heheheee!",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "voiceIdx": 6,
            "pathId": 8838305587487817038,
            "blockIdx": 7
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ナイスネイチャ",
            "enName": "Nice Nature",
            "jpText": "うわ……ドヤってるし。",
            "enText": "Ugh, it's totally gone to her head.",
            "nextBlock": 9,
            "voiceIdx": 7,
            "pathId": -8065656480710987743,
            "blockIdx": 8
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ツインターボ",
            "enName": "Twin Turbo",
            "jpText": "ターボが1番！　ターボが1番！",
            "enText": "Turbo's number one! Turbo's number one!",
            "nextBlock": 10,
            "voiceIdx": 8,
            "pathId": 5549212959540901193,
            "blockIdx": 9
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ナイスネイチャ",
            "enName": "Nice Nature",
            "jpText": "……なんか知らんけどイラっとするから、\r\nターボのお誕生会はお預けにしようか。",
            "enText": "Okay, now I'm kinda annoyed, so I say \nwe call off Turbo's birthday party.",
            "nextBlock": 11,
            "voiceIdx": 9,
            "pathId": -5674323180928750280,
            "blockIdx": 10
        },
        {
            "jpName": "イクノディクタス",
            "enName": "Ikuno Dictus",
            "jpText": "私たちの誕生日もすぐなので、そこで\nターボさんの分もまとめてやりましょう。",
            "enText": "With our birthdays coming up so soon, \nwe can simply celebrate hers then as well.",
            "nextBlock": 12,
            "voiceIdx": 10,
            "pathId": 4535345923722500125,
            "blockIdx": 11
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ツインターボ",
            "enName": "Twin Turbo",
            "jpText": "やだやだやだっ！！\r\n今日やってくれなきゃやだー！",
            "enText": "No, no, no!! You have to do it today!",
            "nextBlock": -1,
            "voiceIdx": 11,
            "pathId": 6319258063656943210,
            "blockIdx": 12
        }
    ],
